h.jpg"}, {"id": 1989774, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16nbi.jpg"}, {"id": 1989777, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16nbl.jpg"}], "slug": "no-asteroids", "storyline": "An asteroid will hit Earth in 90 days. After spending another 90 days arguing over who should pay, the government hires a miner who brings his own pickaxe, asks for no money and claims the asteroid will pay for itself. Each day the miner travels from the ship to the asteroid, extracts ore while the air supply lasts and returns to sell it for better equipment. Meanwhile, people on Earth watch the work, place bets and trade the land at the projected impact site. Artifacts recovered from the rock are displayed in the ship\u2019s museum, and further mining contracts become available after the main contract.", "summary": "No Asteroids is a first-person incremental mining game set on an asteroid on a collision course with Earth. Players have 90 days to excavate 5,000,000 cubic metres of rock, sell the ore and upgrade their tools and ship-mounted weapons. Mining equipment progresses from a pickaxe to homing missile swarms, while automated ship guns help break apart the asteroid. The campaign can be played solo or in online co-op with up to eight players, with a shared economy and progression saved by the host.", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/no-asteroids", "videos": [{"id": 203300, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "I3FN9UxIcfY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I3FN9UxIcfY", "title": "No Asteroids | Co-op Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/I3FN9UxIcfY/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 203301, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "1CkSMLnPCbw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1CkSMLnPCbw", "title": "No Asteroids | Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1CkSMLnPCbw/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 203302, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "DO